 "notes": "Inventory = acko.com/life/product-disclosures (static two-table page, columns Products|UIN only, no dates or categories; 10 Active + 3 Withdrawn; scraper-friendly). Segment/category inferred from product names and document titles (e.g. 'Credit Life' master policies); the two Micro-Insurance group products are placed in segment Micro. Acko says it currently sells only term insurance (individual: Flexi Term, Saral Jeevan Bima). Official brochures/CIS hosted on acko-cms.ackoassets.com and assets.ctfassets.net were not fetchable (host not on fetch allowlist), so Flexi Term specs come from acko.com marketing pages plus aggregators, with unresolved conflicts: max entry age 65 (Acko page, Ditto) vs 70 (PolicyX); max maturity age 70 (Ditto) vs 85 (PolicyX); PPT regular-only (Ditto) vs regular/single/limited (PolicyX); min SA Rs 25 lakh (Acko banner, Ditto) vs Rs 10 lakh-90 crore on another Acko page. Flexi Term launch per PR Newswire 2024-12-04 (brochure effective 2024-10-01). Saral Jeevan Bima specs not retrieved (IRDAI standard-product limits apply). Withdrawn rows are superseded versions (V01 replaced by V02); Credit Shield Combi V02 documents are dated Jan 2025; no withdrawal dates are shown. Rider limits (ADB/ATPD up to Rs 2 crore, CI up to Rs 50 lakh for 21 illnesses) are aggregator (Ditto) figures. Group and micro product specs not collected."
